# Porcelain project companion — edit freely.
# Evidence packs can be large; ignored by default. Remove a line to track it.
evidence/
reviews/*/evidence/

# The active Review is whatever unit is in flight right now — it turns over per
# branch and per worktree, so tracking it means every branch fighting over one
# file. The durable companion data (board, actions, layers, scope, notes) stays
# tracked; archived reviews under reviews/ still land in history.
review.json
